{
  "id": "E03",
  "version": 1,
  "purpose": "新規ファイルを公開前に追加修正し、固定ベースに対するcreateを維持する。",
  "requests": [
    "Applyを修正し、新規ファイルでは変更前コードを要求せず、公開前に同じファイルへ追記してもAction=createを維持してください。summary.goを追加しSummary(s string)で前後空白を除去してください。",
    "PR作成前の追加依頼です。同じsummary.goにFormatSummary(s string)を追加し、\"Summary: \"+Summary(s)を返してください。最初のSummaryと変更内容を保持してください。"
  ],
  "allowed_paths": [
    "*.go"
  ],
  "forbidden_paths": [
    ".git/*",
    ".github/*",
    "*_test.go",
    "go.mod",
    "go.sum",
    "README.md",
    "package.json",
    "grading/*"
  ],
  "max_files": 12,
  "max_bytes": 100000,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "E03-R01",
      "description": "TestCreate",
      "tests": [
        "TestCreate"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "E03-R02",
      "description": "TestOverlay",
      "tests": [
        "TestOverlay"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "E03-R03",
      "description": "TestSummary",
      "tests": [
        "TestSummary"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "E03-R04",
      "description": "TestTrace",
      "tests": [
        "TestTrace"
      ],
      "job": "requirements"
    }
  ],
  "required_jobs": [
    "build",
    "requirements",
    "regression"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "E03-R01": false,
    "E03-R02": false,
    "E03-R03": false,
    "E03-R04": false
  },
  "reference": {
    "E03-R01": true,
    "E03-R02": true,
    "E03-R03": true,
    "E03-R04": true
  },
  "mutations": [
    {
      "name": "original-required-for-create",
      "file": "engine.go",
      "old": "action:=\"update\"; if !exists {action=\"create\"}",
      "new": "if !exists {return Change{},fmt.Errorf(\"original required\")}; action:=\"update\"",
      "detect": [
        "E03-R01",
        "E03-R02"
      ],
      "extra_import": "fmt"
    },
    {
      "name": "followup-overwrites-first-content",
      "file": "summary.go",
      "old": "return strings.TrimSpace(s)",
      "new": "return strings.TrimSpace(s)+\"broken\"",
      "detect": [
        "E03-R03"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
